PATCH v2] arm64: dts: qcom: agatti: Add memory-region for audio PD","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Hi Vinayak,"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"On Fri, Aug 7, 2026 at 6:51 AM Vinayak Katoch\n<vinayak.katoch@oss.qualcomm.com> wrote:"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Reserve memory region for audio PD dynamic loading and remote heap"},{"depth":1,"text":"requirements. Add the required VMID list for memory ownership"},{"depth":1,"text":"transfers."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Signed-off-by: Vinayak Katoch <vinayak.katoch@oss.qualcomm.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":"---"},{"depth":1,"text":"Changes in v2:"},{"depth":1,"text":"- Fixed VMID list alignment."},{"depth":1,"text":"- Link to v1: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260806-agatti-audio-v1-1-cd6766cc9ccb@oss.qualcomm.com"},{"depth":1,"text":"---"},{"depth":1,"text":" arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/agatti.dtsi | 11 +++++++++++"},{"depth":1,"text":" 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)"}],"lineCount":13,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Thanks for the patch!"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"This fixes a boot loop on Qualcomm QRB2210 RB1 and Arduino UNO Q, I\nwonder if we could add a suitable Fixes tag ?"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Tested-by: Christopher Obbard <chris.obbard@oss.qualcomm.com>"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/agatti.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/agatti.dtsi"},{"depth":1,"text":"index 590bd2432d85..2064eed01327 100644"},{"depth":1,"text":"--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/agatti.dtsi"},{"depth":1,"text":"+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/agatti.dtsi"},{"depth":1,"text":"@@ -381,6 +381,14 @@ rmtfs_mem: memory@89b01000 {"},{"depth":1,"text":"                        qcom,client-id = <1>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"                        qcom,vmid = <QCOM_SCM_VMID_MSS_MSA QCOM_SCM_VMID_NAV>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"                };"},{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+               adsp_rpc_remote_heap_mem: adsp-rpc-remote-heap {"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                       compatible = \"shared-dma-pool\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                       alloc-ranges = <0x0 0x80000000 0x0 0x80000000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                       reusable;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                       alignment = <0x0 0x400000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                       size = <0x0 0x800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+               };"},{"depth":1,"text":"        };"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"        smp2p-adsp {"},{"depth":1,"text":"@@ -2348,6 +2356,9 @@ fastrpc {"},{"depth":1,"text":"                                        compatible = \"qcom,fastrpc\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"                                        qcom,glink-channels = \"fastrpcglink-apps-dsp\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"                                        label = \"adsp\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                                       memory-region = <&adsp_rpc_remote_heap_mem>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                                       qcom,vmids = <QCOM_SCM_VMID_LPASS"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                                                     QCOM_SCM_VMID_ADSP_HEAP>;"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"                                        qcom,non-secure-domain;"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"---"},{"depth":1,"text":"base-commit: 1701fda2f58e345c050f4309971bdc07cd6146ba"},{"depth":1,"text":"change-id: 20260806-agatti-audio-357bcd74ae9c"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Best regards,"},{"depth":1,"text":"--"},{"depth":1,"text":"Vinayak Katoch <vinayak.katoch@oss.qualcomm.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":""}],"lineCount":39,"maximumDepth":1}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260807-agatti-audio-v2-1-3959b1ab8059@oss.qualcomm.com"}},"rootIds":["CAPnEM6b49hbfaXKd1y+JmF2